' Ditulis manual. Deployment diagram.
@startuml deployment
!include _gaya.iuml
title Deployment Diagram — TK Orchid

node "Perangkat Pengguna\n(PC / laptop / HP)" as Client {
  artifact "Peramban web\n(Chrome, Safari, Firefox)" as Browser
}

node "Server Aplikasi\n(VPS / server sekolah, 1 instance)" as Server {
  node "Runtime Node.js 20+" {
    artifact "Aplikasi Next.js\n(npm run build && npm run start)" as App
    artifact "Prisma Client +\nbetter-sqlite3" as Orm
  }
  database "prisma/dev.db\n(SQLite)" as DB
  folder "Folder unggahan\n(foto & dokumen)" as Up
  file ".env\n(AUTH_SECRET)" as Env
}

node "Layanan Pihak Ketiga" as Ext {
  artifact "WhatsApp (tautan wa.me)" as WA
  artifact "Google Maps (embed)" as Maps
}

Browser --> App : HTTPS (port 443 → 3000)
App --> Orm
Orm --> DB : akses berkas lokal
App --> Up
App ..> Env : baca konfigurasi
Browser ..> WA : tautan kontak
Browser ..> Maps : peta lokasi

note right of DB
  SQLite butuh disk persisten dan cocok
  untuk satu instance. Cadangkan berkas
  dev.db secara berkala.
end note
@enduml
